{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>進行油漆、鋪設瓷磚或地板工程時，事前準備足夠的材料與預算十分關鍵。原價 US $0.99 的《FixCalc》是一款專為裝修與修繕設計的材料計算工具，現在提供限時免費下載。這款 App 能協助你精確估算所需材料數量與整體費用，讓你前往工具店採購前做好全面準備。</p>\n\n<h2>精準估算材料並導出購物清單</h2>\n<p>這款工具支援油漆、瓷磚和地板工程計算，輸入房間尺寸、覆蓋面積與損耗率即可換算所需包裝量與費用。系統可檢查缺失數據並自動切換單位，用戶能按項目歸類儲存估算，匯出 PDF 購物清單或於 Apple Watch 上查閱，數據全數留在本地裝置，保障私隱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-324-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-325-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-326-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-327-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-328-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-329-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FixCalc: Material Calculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T05:19:11.683569+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}